{"id":"n62908-2-7","stage":1,"title":"가슴 · 胸前","scene":"问胸前别着的徽章","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62908-2-7-1","ko":"가슴에 달린 게 뭐니?","zh":"你胸前别着的是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가슴에","meaning":"胸前","explanation":"가슴：胸前；这里指衣服胸前的位置，-에 标记徽章所在处。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"2","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴에","audio":"/audio/8ee78fe9887384e676be.mp3"}},{"text":"달린","meaning":"别着的、附着的","explanation":"달리다：附着、挂着；-ㄴ 修饰后面的 게，这里指别在胸前的徽章。","readings":[{"term":"달리다","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61300","senseId":"1","lemma":"달리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달린","audio":"/audio/c62c645fb0f84ec2a00d.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"那个东西","explanation":"게 是 것이 的缩略，指前面说的胸前别着的东西。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐니","audio":"/audio/c123f71de2e0a9dffdf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"胸前","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"遮盖人脖子和肚子之间身体前面部分的衣服的一部分。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"605b9178b6748898","term":"달리다","zh":"附着、别着","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3","entryId":"61300","definition":"某物固定或挂在一处；本句指徽章别在胸前。","pronunciation":["달리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西、事物","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"代指前面提到的物品；게 是 것이 的缩略。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/200881c6440cdc2ea17a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62908-2-7-2","ko":"응, 우리 학교 배지야.","zh":"嗯，是我们学校的徽章啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"응：对亲近的人作回应，接着说明胸前别着的是学校徽章。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"배지야.","meaning":"徽章","explanation":"배지：徽章；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"배지","audio":"/audio/57ff1b60f5b9be4b7545.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58335","senseId":"1","lemma":"배지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배지야","audio":"/audio/d4c2f448a499d6cedc6d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"对熟悉的人作回应；这里引出徽章的说明。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"57ff1b60f5b9be4b","term":"배지","zh":"徽章","audio":"/audio/57ff1b60f5b9be4b7545.mp3","entryId":"58335","definition":"佩带在上衣或帽子上的一种小东西，以告知身份、所属或表示某种意义。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/388bdca43ab7ea8de668.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.238,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62908","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.7181,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，是我们学校的徽章啊。","你胸前别着的是什么呀？","妈妈，我去上学了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你胸前别着的是什么呀？","妈妈，我去上学了。","嗯，是我们学校的徽章啊。"],"answer":2}]}
